/E (The routine helps students make connections between new ideas and prior knowledge. It also encourages them to take stock of ongoing questions, puzzles and difficulties as they reflect on what they are learning. How is the artwork or object connected to something you know about? )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
