1812 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1393 0 R
/E (This routine can be used to enhance comprehension of reading, watching, or listening. It can also be used as a reflection on previous events or learnings. It is helpful if students have had some previous experience with highlighting texts for important ideas, connections, or events. The synthesis happens as students select a color, symbol, and image to represent three important ideas. This routine also facilitates the discussion of a text or event as students share their colors, symbols, and images. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1813 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1393 0 R
/T (Color, Symbol, Image)
/E (Color, Symbol, Image)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
