2344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1417 0 R
/E (This routine can be useful as a pre-assessment before the beginning of a unit of study if students already have a lot of background information about the topic. Conversely, it can also be useful as a post or ongoing assessment to see whatstudents are remembering and how they are connecting ideas. Individual maps can be used as the basis for construction of a whole classroom map. Maps can also be done progressively, with students adding to their maps each week of the unit.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [16]
>>
