2397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1420 0 R
/E (The routine encourages students to consider past perspectives and develop a better understanding of how thinking changes over time and across cultures. It helps students acknowledge that we have strong stances regarding controversial issues, and that our stances are influenced by social and historical context. It is also helps to uncover stereotypical perceptions as well as ethnocentric and presentist judgments.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [13]
>>
