2684 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1435 0 R
/E (If students are new to this routine, start with short excerpts of music. You can invite students to close eyes if that is comfortable for them or soften their gaze and just listen the first time. Then, during the second listen, they might write or draw in response to what they are hearing. If a list of ten things seems like a lot at first, begin with an invitation to list 3-5 things that students notice, then they can pair with a partner to compare lists.)
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
