2921 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1448 0 R
/E (This routine helps students slow down and look closely at systems, with special emphasis on the various ways people engage with or are implicated in systems. Like the other routines that begin with identifying parts, the routine encourages students to make careful observations. It also encourages them to identify various kinds of causal interactions, and to consider the numerous ways that people affect and are effected by systems.)
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
