/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1458 0 R
/E (This routine encourages learners to slow down and make careful, detailed observations as they look beyond the obvious features of an object or system and think about how it works. This thinking routine can help foster curiosity as children notice details, ask questions, make connections, and identify topics for future inquiry.)
/Pg 88 0 R
/K [8]
>>
