/T (APPLICATION When and where can I use it? You can use this thinking routine to explore any object or system. You may choose to introduce the entire routine at once, or you may choose to break it down into parts over multiple occasions.)
/E (APPLICATION When and where can I use it? You can use this thinking routine to explore any object or system. You may choose to introduce the entire routine at once, or you may choose to break it down into parts over multiple occasions.)
