3235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1462 0 R
/E (To heighten awareness that what is learned in and out of school are often connected with each other. These connections can enable moving forward to achieve goals. This fosters intrinsic motivation. It provokes curiosity, wonder and delight in finding the unexpected. Exploring the connections can broaden and deepen understanding.)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
