3384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1470 0 R
/E (This routine encourages learners to view topics \(e.g. ideas, phenomena and problems\) from the vantage of a broader timescale, than what they have learned from the media, or experienced in their own lifetime. Often, ideas \(e.g. childhood; debt; happiness\), phenomena \(e.g. the Internet; migration\), or problems \(e.g. lack of access to clean water; terrorism\), can look very different depending on how far back in history or how far forward into the future we look.)
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
