3917 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1498 0 R
/E (The Stop, Look, Listen routine helps students investigate truth claims and issues related to truth. It allows students to stand back and think about ways to obtain information when trying to find out about the truth of something. Students are encouraged to think critically about sources. This process helps students appreciate the deeper complexity of truth situations by addressing issues of bias and objectivity.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
