3920 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1498 0 R
/E (This routine invites students to think carefully about the process of initiating truth investigations. It can be used in any situation in which students need to find out more about a truth claim. It helps students step back and take a questioning stance in order to clarify a claim. Use the routine when you want students to be open minded and to think broadly about sources of information.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
