4078 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 9033 0 R
/T (Have one group collect their index cards and pass them to another group. Upon receiving the new note cards, the cards are randomly distributed and each student reads and responds to the card they receive. Cards are then recollected and passed back to the group from which they came.)
/E (Have one group collect their index cards and pass them to another group. Upon receiving the new note cards, the cards are randomly distributed and each student reads and responds to the card they receive. Cards are then recollected and passed back to the group from which they came.)
/Pg 136 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
