/P 9121 0 R
/E (Encourage students to notice that not everyone in a system feels the same way or cares about thesame things. Have them talk about this. Why might different people have different perspectives?What problems might arise because of this? What might be some benefits of this?)
/Pg 147 0 R
/K [7]
>>
