4395 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1522 0 R
/E (The True for Who routine helps students cast a wide net for facts and arguments by imagining how an issue looks from different points of view. The routine also helps students see how different viewpoints and situations might influence the stances people are likely to take.)
/Pg 152 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
