4398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1522 0 R
/E (What we think is true often depends on what we see and care about from our own perspective. Like the Circle of Viewpoints routine, this routine helps students consider the roles of context and perspective in shaping what people believe. It can be used at any point in the process of puzzling about truth, once the truth-claim has been clarified.)
/Pg 152 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
