/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1535 0 R
/E (The only constant in our complex world is change. Change can elicit uncertainty and fear, yet change can also provide new opportunities. This routine is designed to encourage exploration of possibilities and to build agency in imagining and creating how things could change and what can be.)
/Pg 165 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
