/T (LAUNCH What are some tips for starting and using this routine? The routine can be introduced and incorporated in one lesson, or in one or more steps over time. The process can be planned or shaped in response to discussions it elicits, and depending on the purpose and context in which it is being utilized. It can be broken into steps in whichever order is most relevant and time frame that is effective, sometimes involving revisiting steps over time.  )
