4789 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1542 0 R
/E (This routine helps students analyze events and explore documents in more depth by constructing a set of narratives around those events. Learners begin with the main narrative to capture the core or central story being told. Then, by looking for side stories, students are encouraged to identify additional points of view that are present, but which are not the main focus. Looking beneath the surface of events to uncover the hidden story, learners are invited to explore the complexities of the narrative or the situation. )
/Pg 172 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
