/P 1543 0 R
/T (2. Main. Invite students \(working individually or in pairs\) to identify the main story that captures the central ideas that are most apparent.)
/E (2. Main. Invite students \(working individually or in pairs\) to identify the main story that captures the central ideas that are most apparent.)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [3]
>>
