/S /H3
/P 1543 0 R
/T (3. Side. Prompt students to identify possible side stories. What else is going on here around the edges? Who are the other actors that might be contributing to the main story but are not the major players?)
/E (3. Side. Prompt students to identify possible side stories. What else is going on here around the edges? Who are the other actors that might be contributing to the main story but are not the major players?)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [4]
>>
