/Title (You may want to assure them that they will have access to your slides or lecture notes so that students are worried about missing important information. Explaining the psychology behind this routine can help students learn how to learn. The routine is not simply an activity you are asking to students to do, but a tool designed to help us use out brains more effectively for learning. You may wish to tell students that research has shown it is important to engage memory right away when something is learned rather than waiting to try and memorize things for a test later.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 12262 0 R
/Prev 13731 0 R
/Next 13732 0 R
>>
