/Title (Lead students in filling out the target diagram. Let them suggest main purposes \(sometimes there is more than one\), particular parts and the purposes they serve, and who the audience is. Also, invite them to star \(*\) any part they think is particularly smart or creative. You can conduct this as a general conversation, but another good way is to ask students to fill out Post-Its individually or in small groups and stick them up on the diagram.)
