16161 0 obj
<<
/Title (LAUNCH What are some tips for starting and using this routine? This routine works well as a whole class discussion. Use the idea of the time traveler to help students think about fairness issues and values that have changed significantly over time or place. When comparing past and present stances acknowledge that certain issues may not be controversial to us today. List how we think about it presently and ask students to step back and consider how people thought about the topic during another place and time. What was their reasoning? Make these ideas visible. Explore the possible reasons for our shifts in thinking about this topic. Why do we view it differently? How could we find out more information?)
/Dest [51 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 16155 0 R
/First 16166 0 R
/Last 16166 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
