/Title (You may realize, as you engage with this thinking routine, that the system you have selected ismore complicated or abstract than you originally thought. This is okay. Help students look closelyat the parts that they are interested in, and feel free to help them seek more information by askingeach other, by using books or the internet, or by consulting with community members. It is okayif students have unanswered questions about the system. Consider documenting these questionsto revisit if the opportunity presents itself later on.)
